# Lanternwake common deck (after CH16): crew room, formation, CH21 rumor board.

@scene W_IVO
say ivo | She's slow. She's heavy. Every part has a name in the manual, and every name has a spare in the hold.
say ivo | Nothing on this ship needs a person inside it to run.
@end

@scene W_CREW
say pilot | Climb the ladder to take the helm. Land on the marked fields by towns and ruins - look for the flattened grass.
say pilot | On foot, stand on any marked field and call her; she'll come to you.
@end

@scene W_FORMATION
say sailor | Swapping who goes ashore? Take your time.
formation
@end

@scene W_REST
say pilot | Crew bunks. Two hours' sleep and a hot drink.
inn 0
@end

@scene W_RUMORS
say scholar | The crew room board. Everyone pins up what they've heard.
journal | Crew board: Mara in Brackenford is gathering the quarry names (Raven). A Bellharbor apprentice wants Morwen (Morwen). Edda wants a wall for returners (Vespera). Pell says the engine only runs when the Golem stands by it (Golem).
journal | Crew board: two Brackenford camps want different roads (Elowen). A patient at Nacre refuses an order in Aurex's hand (Aurex). A Whitebone survivor wants another binding site found (Oni). Jori has people whose names changed (Sak).
journal | Crew board: an island lantern north of Nacre burns while its village never wakes. A Hearthward bell repeats a lost ship's departure. A machine under Veyr still issues Voss's orders. Nacre's pool holds a voice nobody claims.
say scholar | (The leads are recorded in your Journal. None of them is required to reach Crown Heart.)
@end
